    <briefdescription>
<para>Experimental <computeroutput><ref refid="classmathic_1_1_geobucket" kindref="compound">mathic::Geobucket</ref></computeroutput> configuration whose <computeroutput><ref refid="class_our_queue_configuration_adb3a2a214470b346bec580e5674a7ddd_1adb3a2a214470b346bec580e5674a7ddd" kindref="member">Entry</ref></computeroutput> is an <computeroutput><ref refid="classint" kindref="compound">int</ref></computeroutput> <mdash/> a placeholder used by <computeroutput><ref refid="_n_c_reduction_8cpp_a7e1541e136a7eb6d67513c4a420027ba_1a7e1541e136a7eb6d67513c4a420027ba" kindref="member">makeQueue()</ref></computeroutput> to exercise the geobucket machinery without involving real monomials. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Compare is integer ordering, deduplication is disabled. Useful as a scaffolding/sanity-check configuration when wiring the noncommutative reduction code against the mathic queue templates. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
